{"unit":3,"items":21,"pass":15,"title":"Unit Test · Unit 3","html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Unit Test\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Unit 3 &middot; Unit Test</div>\n      <h2>Work</h2>\n      <p>Twenty-one questions on Lessons 9&ndash;12: jobs, questions, requests. Answer them all, then press Check. You need <b>15 out of 21</b> to pass &mdash; and you can take this test as many times as you like.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"review-u3\">\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Part 1 &middot; Grammar and vocabulary &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 1&ndash;15</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Choose the correct answer.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">___ she work at night?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Does</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Is</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Do</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">___ they like the job?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Does</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Do</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Are</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Does he travel a lot? — No, he ___.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">isn't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">don't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">doesn't</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">He ___ wear a uniform.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">isn't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">don't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">doesn't</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">___ does your brother work? — In a bank.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Where</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">What</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Who</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">___ do you spell that?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">What</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Why</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">How</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"body\">What time ___ she start?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">does</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">is</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">do</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">8</span><span class=\"body\">A ___ works in a hospital.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">waiter</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">nurse</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">farmer</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"body\">A journalist writes for a ___.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">kitchen</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">hospital</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">newspaper</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">10</span><span class=\"body\">She earns a good ___.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">office</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">salary</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">uniform</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">11</span><span class=\"body\">___ you help me, please?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Could</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Am</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Was</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">12</span><span class=\"body\">___ I borrow your pen?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Am</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Do</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Can</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span class=\"body\">I'm ___ I can't help you today.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">apologize</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">afraid</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">sorry that no</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">14</span><span class=\"body\">Can you repeat that, please? — ___\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Sure.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Yes, I am.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">It is.</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">15</span><span class=\"body\">Dear Ms Lee, … Best ___, Marat\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">hello</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">wishes</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">gifts</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 2 &middot; Write the answer &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 16&ndash;21</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Type your answer. Spelling counts; capital letters and full stops do not.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">16</span><span class=\"body\">Make a question: She works at night.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Does she work at night?\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">17</span><span class=\"body\">Make a question: They earn a good salary.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Do they earn a good salary?\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">18</span><span class=\"body\">Ask about the place: he works<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Where does he work?\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">19</span><span class=\"body\">Make it polite: Give me your pen.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Could you give me your pen, please?|Can you give me your pen, please?\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">20</span><span class=\"body\">Fix the mistake: Do she work here?<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Does she work here?\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">21</span><span class=\"body\">Fix the mistake: Could you to help me?<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Could you help me?\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"checkReview(this)\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Check my answers</button>\n      <div class=\"res\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"reviewResult\" class=\"review-result\"></div>\n  </section>\n"}